    <paragraph>For the following exercises, use a calculator to graph the function over the interval $$\lbrack a,b\rbrack$$ and graph the secant line from $$a$$ to $$b.$$ Use the calculator to estimate all values of $$c$$ as guaranteed by the Mean Value Theorem. Then, find the exact value of $$c,$$ if possible, or write the final equation and use a calculator to estimate to four digits.</paragraph>
