    <exercise number="190" has_solution="false">
      <problem>
        <paragraph>At 10:17 a.m., you pass a police car at 55 mph that is stopped on the freeway. You pass a second police car at 55 mph at 10:53 a.m., which is located 39 mi from the first police car. If the speed limit is 60 mph, can the police cite you for speeding?</paragraph>
      </problem>
